!test/config.json
# Run output from `scripts/arweave-live-sync.sh'. Acceptance logs are large
# and are not evidence anyone can re-derive from the tree, so they are kept out
# of it; score a run where it was produced.
evidence/

# The Arweave block fixtures are frozen mainnet data that cannot be refetched --
# peers prune the reward and block-time histories about fifty blocks behind the
# tip. `*.json' and `*.bin' above match every one of them, so they survive only
# by already being in the index; a `git add .' in a fresh clone would drop them
# and the suite would go red with `git status' saying clean. It has happened.
!test/fixtures/**
